  "details": "A vulnerability was determined in SciPhi-AI R2R up to 3.6.6. This affects an unknown part of the component JWT Secret Handler. This manipulation of the argument DEFAULT_BCRYPT_SECRET_KEY/DEFAULT_NACL_SECRET_KEY causes hard-coded credentials. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been publicly disclosed and may be utilized. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.",
